        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Tally Trigger').item.json.question_1MXPlL.value }},\n\nThank you for reaching out. I have received your inquiry regarding {{ $('Tally Trigger').item.json.question_gLaj0K.value }}, and I appreciate you taking the time to share your needs.\n\nBased on what you have shared, I believe there is a strong opportunity to build something valuable together. I would like to schedule a short discovery call to better understand your goals and walk you through exactly how I can help.\n\nOn the call, we will cover:\n• Your current challenges and what you are looking to solve\n• The approach I would recommend for your specific situation\n• Next steps, timeline, and how we move forward.\nThe call takes no more than 30 minutes, and there is no obligation on your end.\n\nTo book a time that works for you, reply to this email with your availability or use the link below:\n\n[Booking Link]\n\nI look forward to speaking with you.\n\nBest regards,\nJoshua T. Ikotun",
